# A pin cannot read a name a later part binds, but a scope inside the pin may
# bind that name afresh: here a match arm and a lambda parameter, each gone
# before the later part binds. Subtle beside pin-reads-a-later-part, which is
# an unbound-name error.
#= {result: [2, 4], inputs: {xs: [1, 2, 3, 4]}}
def [(match 1 { a => a }), a, ((fn b -> b * 3)(1)), b] = xs
[a, b]
